      "visual_description": "A close-up shot shows two pale, simplified hands exchanging a folded, blank, off-white paper. A hand with a brown sleeve is on the left, presenting the paper to a hand with a slate-blue coat cuff and pale cuff on the right. The background is a textured, warm-toned wall, possibly stone or timber, rendered in an illustrated style with strong dark contours.",
