      "shot_id": "shot003",
      "visual_description": "A medium shot of a stick-figure character, the 'lead guard', wearing a dark felt hat, a slate-blue coat with a pale collar and cuffs, and a white shirt. He has a round, off-white head with simple dot eyes and a closed mouth. He holds an open, creased, blank off-white paper in both hands, reading it. An anonymous brown-sleeved hand is visible retreating from the left edge of the frame. The background is a warm-toned, illustrated wall.",
