      "shot_id": "shot004",
      "visual_description": "A close-up of a pale, simplified hand, belonging to the lead guard, holding an iron candle lantern. A small, practical flame burns inside the lantern. The hand slightly raises the lantern. In the background, a closed, left-hinged wooden door with iron hardware is visible, set into a stone archway. The art style is consistent with illustrated stick-figures and drawn environments.",
      "cut_type": "Hard Cut"
    },
    {
      "start_s": 2.375,
