      "shot_id": "shot005",
      "visual_description": "A close-up of the lead guard's pale hand, with a slate-blue coat cuff, releasing a dark iron latch on the closed wooden door. The door is made of oak planks and is set in a stone wall. The lighting is warm, emanating from the left.",
      "cut_type": "Hard Cut"
    },
    {
      "start_s": 2.875,
      "end_s": 3.208,
      "shot_id": "shot006",
      "visual_description": "A wide shot reveals an open wooden door leading into a cellar or storage room filled with numerous wooden barrels stacked along arched passageways. Three stick-figure characters are present: the lead guard (left, holding the lantern), a character resembling Guy Fawkes (center, with a dark felt hat, moustache, beard, and dark cloak), and another guard (right, wearing a buff coat, steel-gray helmet, and holding a polearm). The lead guard's hand is open and extended towards Fawkes.",
