      "visual_description": "A medium shot of the three characters in the cellar. The lead guard (left) moves his open, pale hand closer to Fawkes' dark-sleeved arm. Fawkes (center) stands with a neutral expression, and the second guard (right) holds his polearm. The background shows the barrels in the cellar.",
      "cut_type": "Hard Cut"
    },
    {
